WEBVTT

00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:08.570
Each time my feelings have missed or
clashed with another's, I've wished...

00:00:09.570 --> 00:00:15.950
that we could express our thoughts
through words and emotions.

00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:18.910
But there will always be someone
who holds onto a strong wish,

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:21.960
who ignores words and
goes against what's right...

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:27.040
A strong heart, not words,
is needed to reach them.

00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:34.130
In our hearts, we decided to face them,
without misgivings or doubt in our eyes.

00:00:34.930 --> 00:00:39.060
Mahou Shoujo Lyrical
Nanoha A's will now begin.

00:02:35.630 --> 00:02:39.510
That's all the data we have.
Is it of any use to you?

00:02:40.220 --> 00:02:43.720
Yes, thank you.
It'll really help us out.

00:02:46.020 --> 00:02:49.020
Aren't you scheduled to come
back here for a bit today?

00:02:49.020 --> 00:02:51.730
Yeah, for the matter with the Arthra.

00:02:52.110 --> 00:02:54.980
Want to meet up at some point
and have a bite to eat?

00:02:55.690 --> 00:02:57.570
After all, I do want to
hear about that girl.

00:02:59.530 --> 00:03:00.660
"That girl"?

00:03:00.660 --> 00:03:06.080
You know, that girl you're currently taking
care of, the one you wanted to adopt.

00:03:06.080 --> 00:03:08.830
Ah! You mean Fate-san.

00:03:08.830 --> 00:03:11.120
Yeah, Fate-chan.

00:03:11.120 --> 00:03:12.580
Is she doing well?

00:03:12.580 --> 00:03:13.580
Yeah.

00:03:15.040 --> 00:03:20.130
I'm sorry for bringing
her into this case, but...

00:03:20.130 --> 00:03:24.430
it looks like she's getting along
with her friends and having fun.

00:03:36.070 --> 00:03:38.780
With a Broken Past and Present.

00:03:46.950 --> 00:03:49.870
Th-There sure are a lot of them...

00:03:49.870 --> 00:03:53.960
Well, they pretty much
all do the same thing...

00:03:53.960 --> 00:03:56.630
so just pick the one you
think looks the best.

00:03:56.630 --> 00:03:59.710
But one that's good for text
messaging would be best.

00:04:00.470 --> 00:04:03.680
If you get one with a nice camera,
you can do lots of fun stuff, too.

00:04:05.760 --> 00:04:09.350
But in the end, the color and
design are most important.

00:04:09.350 --> 00:04:11.930
Ease of use is also important!

00:04:11.930 --> 00:04:15.350
You know, if it has external memory,
that could be really convenient.

00:04:15.350 --> 00:04:16.650
Really?

00:04:16.650 --> 00:04:20.440
Yeah! You can put lots of
pictures and music on it.

00:04:20.440 --> 00:04:25.070
Yeah! Then you can send them to
your friends in text messages!

00:04:25.070 --> 00:04:27.280
Ah, there's that, too.

00:04:27.280 --> 00:04:28.700
Yeah, lots of people do that...

00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:30.080
That one's nice...

00:04:31.330 --> 00:04:33.040
Thank you very much!

00:04:33.040 --> 00:04:35.080
Yes, thank you.

00:04:39.550 --> 00:04:41.590
Fate-san, here you go.

00:04:42.510 --> 00:04:45.510
Thank you very much, Admiral Lindy.

00:04:52.680 --> 00:04:53.480
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:04:53.480 --> 00:04:54.520
Not at all.

00:04:54.520 --> 00:04:55.770
Did you get a good number?

00:04:56.270 --> 00:04:56.980
Yeah.

00:04:56.980 --> 00:04:58.690
Really? What is it?

00:04:58.690 --> 00:05:01.150
Umm... here.

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:15.120
This is an extremely vast database

00:05:15.120 --> 00:05:18.250
containing all the publications
and data from each world,

00:05:18.250 --> 00:05:20.040
supervised by the Administrative Bureau.

00:05:20.670 --> 00:05:23.710
Countless numbers of
histories are stored here.

00:05:23.710 --> 00:05:27.300
One could almost call this the place where
the memories of the universe are stored.

00:05:29.100 --> 00:05:32.310
That is where we are,
the Infinity Library.

00:05:32.310 --> 00:05:37.020
However, most of the documents
here still need to be organized.

00:05:37.020 --> 00:05:39.770
It's really difficult to find
something in here.

00:05:40.360 --> 00:05:45.700
Normally, a team would first
be formed to do the searching.

00:05:45.700 --> 00:05:50.280
My clan members are historians
and archaeologists by trade.

00:05:50.950 --> 00:05:53.700
I've prepared some search magic, too,

00:05:53.700 --> 00:05:54.290
so I think we'll be all right.

00:05:54.790 --> 00:05:58.170
I see. You said you were one of
the Scrya children, didn't you?

00:05:58.870 --> 00:06:04.920
Lotte and I have work to do,
so we can't stay here the whole time...

00:06:04.920 --> 00:06:06.420
but we'll help as much as we can.

00:06:07.260 --> 00:06:10.890
After all, our cutest and favoritest
pupil Chrosuke asked us!

00:06:14.520 --> 00:06:18.730
I see... Arisa and Suzuka are both
learning how to play the violin.

00:06:18.730 --> 00:06:19.400
Yeah.

00:06:20.020 --> 00:06:23.520
They text me about
their lessons all the time.

00:06:24.030 --> 00:06:25.280
I see.

00:06:25.280 --> 00:06:26.900
I'm back!

00:06:36.870 --> 00:06:39.290
Has the captain already
left for the main office?

00:06:39.290 --> 00:06:43.170
Yeah. Since the Arthra's armament
upgrades have been completed,

00:06:43.170 --> 00:06:46.550
she said she was going to take a
test flight with Alex and Randy.

00:06:46.550 --> 00:06:51.010
An armament upgrade...
the Arc-en-ciel, huh?

00:06:51.720 --> 00:06:55.810
I hope we can finish things without
having to use that dangerous weapon...

00:06:56.270 --> 00:06:58.920
Chrono-kun's not here, either...

00:06:58.920 --> 00:07:03.060
So until everyone comes back, it seems like
you're the acting commander, Amy-san.

00:07:03.060 --> 00:07:05.070
<i>Quite a bit of responsibility!</i>

00:07:06.230 --> 00:07:10.200
That's a little dangerous... but...

00:07:10.200 --> 00:07:14.160
it's not like a major emergency is
going to happen anytime soo—

00:07:25.710 --> 00:07:30.880
Civilization level zero. It's a desert
world uninhabited by humans.

00:07:37.520 --> 00:07:41.390
At best, it'll take at least 45 minutes for the
Bureau to arrive and put up a barrier there.

00:07:43.150 --> 00:07:45.400
It sure is hot there...

00:07:50.490 --> 00:07:51.360
Amy...

00:07:51.360 --> 00:07:52.570
I'll go.

00:07:52.570 --> 00:07:53.450
Me too.

00:07:55.530 --> 00:07:56.950
Alright. Please do!

00:07:57.410 --> 00:07:58.700
Yeah.

00:07:58.700 --> 00:07:59.700
You got it.

00:08:00.910 --> 00:08:04.210
Nanoha-chan, you'll be backup.
Wait here on standby.

00:08:04.210 --> 00:08:05.210
Okay.

00:08:10.340 --> 00:08:12.470
Let's do this, Bardiche.

00:08:12.470 --> 00:08:13.880
Yes, sir.

00:08:25.440 --> 00:08:28.230
No wonder Vita had so much trouble.

00:08:28.230 --> 00:08:30.230
These are pretty annoying to fight.

00:08:39.660 --> 00:08:41.250
Crap!

00:08:52.380 --> 00:08:53.800
Thunder Blade.

00:09:04.850 --> 00:09:05.560
Break!

00:09:18.780 --> 00:09:21.120
Worried about your master?

00:09:23.540 --> 00:09:25.000
You, huh?

00:09:25.000 --> 00:09:27.580
Our masters are going
to fight one on one.

00:09:28.040 --> 00:09:29.500
We'll do the same.

00:09:31.090 --> 00:09:35.760
Signum is our leader.
She is not our master.

00:09:36.970 --> 00:09:42.770
That must mean... your master's the
master of the Book of Darkness, right?

00:09:51.440 --> 00:09:55.990
Fate-chan! Why did you save her?!
You're supposed to capture her!

00:09:56.280 --> 00:09:58.660
Ah... sorry.

00:09:58.660 --> 00:09:59.620
I just kind of...

00:10:00.530 --> 00:10:02.950
I won't thank you, Testarossa.

00:10:03.950 --> 00:10:05.500
Did I interrupt?

00:10:07.250 --> 00:10:10.250
You destroyed the target whose
Linker Core I was about to collect.

00:10:13.500 --> 00:10:18.010
Then again, I guess getting in the
way of the bad guys is my job, so...

00:10:18.720 --> 00:10:22.430
Is that so?
So I'm a bad guy to you people.

00:10:29.900 --> 00:10:31.440
Another one?!

00:10:36.110 --> 00:10:38.030
And they're somewhere else this time?

00:10:38.030 --> 00:10:39.030
Nanoha-chan!

00:10:39.610 --> 00:10:40.780
Got it!

00:10:43.370 --> 00:10:47.160
It's been a while, Admiral Lindy.

00:10:47.160 --> 00:10:48.040
Yes.

00:10:48.710 --> 00:10:52.540
How goes the Book of Darkness case?

00:10:53.340 --> 00:10:57.340
It's been pretty difficult so far,
but we're doing our best to close it.

00:11:00.680 --> 00:11:02.970
You're very talented.

00:11:02.970 --> 00:11:06.560
I believe you won't make the same
mistake I did the last time this came up...

00:11:08.100 --> 00:11:11.060
At my husband's funeral,
I believe I told you...

00:11:12.610 --> 00:11:15.070
that it wasn't your fault, Admiral.

00:11:18.690 --> 00:11:22.820
No commander could have
predicted what happened.

00:11:34.000 --> 00:11:38.050
Wow... that magic sure looks handy...

00:11:38.050 --> 00:11:40.300
You can see inside
them all by doing that?

00:11:40.300 --> 00:11:43.800
Yes... um... pretty much.

00:11:44.430 --> 00:11:50.680
Umm... you two also participated in the
previous Book of Darkness case, right?

00:11:50.680 --> 00:11:55.730
Yes, since it was only eleven years ago.

00:11:55.730 --> 00:11:58.730
Umm... is it true?

00:11:58.730 --> 00:12:02.320
That was when Chrono's
father passed away...?

00:12:06.870 --> 00:12:08.700
It's true...

00:12:08.700 --> 00:12:13.830
Aria and I were together with our father,
so we saw it up close...

00:12:14.630 --> 00:12:19.550
The Book was supposed to be sealed,
but while being transported by Clyde-kun...

00:12:19.550 --> 00:12:21.630
Chrono's father, that is.

00:12:21.630 --> 00:12:22.420
Yes...

00:12:25.470 --> 00:12:31.140
We saw Clyde-kun go down with the guard ship.

00:12:32.640 --> 00:12:36.610
So the Arc-en-ciel is the
only way to stop it, huh?

00:12:36.610 --> 00:12:40.900
No other weapon can release
such incredible power.

00:12:41.610 --> 00:12:44.780
That thing causes too
much collateral damage.

00:12:44.780 --> 00:12:47.280
I hope we'll be able to finish
this without having to use it...

00:12:47.280 --> 00:12:49.910
It'd be good if you could find its master.

00:12:52.620 --> 00:12:56.500
Though... even if you do find
and suppress its master,

00:12:56.500 --> 00:12:59.420
the Book of Darkness has
the ability to reincarnate.

00:12:59.420 --> 00:13:05.930
So we'd only delay the problem another
couple of years until it finds a new master.

00:13:06.510 --> 00:13:11.470
Even then, that's still better than causing a huge disaster right now.

00:13:11.470 --> 00:13:12.560
I guess so.

00:13:39.330 --> 00:13:43.670
I'd like to continue delaying the
decisive battle I said we'd finish,

00:13:43.670 --> 00:13:46.340
but you're faster than me.

00:13:46.340 --> 00:13:49.390
If I can't run from you,
I have no choice but to fight.

00:13:49.390 --> 00:13:50.680
Indeed.

00:13:50.680 --> 00:13:52.970
I've come today with that in mind.

00:14:36.140 --> 00:14:38.100
Schlangenform.

00:14:51.700 --> 00:14:54.950
Load Cartridge. Haken Form.

00:14:59.620 --> 00:15:01.500
Haken Saber!

00:15:11.970 --> 00:15:13.100
Take this!

00:15:13.100 --> 00:15:14.560
Blitz Rush.

00:15:27.030 --> 00:15:28.740
Haken Slash.

00:15:32.870 --> 00:15:33.990
Your scabbard?!

00:15:39.620 --> 00:15:41.620
Plasma Lancer.

00:15:47.880 --> 00:15:48.960
Assault Form.

00:15:54.430 --> 00:15:55.890
Schwertform.

00:16:09.320 --> 00:16:10.690
Plasma...

00:16:14.450 --> 00:16:15.820
Flying Dragon...

00:16:16.450 --> 00:16:18.450
...Smasher!

00:16:22.290 --> 00:16:23.290
...Flash!

00:16:50.320 --> 00:16:54.950
If you're also a familiar...
or a guardian beast...

00:16:54.950 --> 00:16:58.620
are you sure you shouldn't try to
be fixing your master's mistake?!

00:16:58.620 --> 00:17:02.700
We fill the Book of Darkness
of our own will.

00:17:02.700 --> 00:17:08.380
Our master... knows nothing of it.

00:17:08.380 --> 00:17:10.340
What did you just say?

00:17:10.340 --> 00:17:11.760
Why are you...

00:17:13.880 --> 00:17:17.800
If it's for my master's sake,
I will stain my hands with blood.

00:17:17.800 --> 00:17:20.390
You're the same type of beast as I,

00:17:20.390 --> 00:17:22.640
can you say you're any different?

00:17:24.980 --> 00:17:29.900
No... but... still...!

00:17:37.700 --> 00:17:39.410
<i>Signum and Zafira?</i>

00:17:39.410 --> 00:17:43.000
<i>Yeah. They're both fighting over the desert...</i>

00:17:43.000 --> 00:17:46.330
<i>with Testarossa-chan
and her guardian beast.</i>

00:17:48.420 --> 00:17:50.590
<i>It'll be bad if it goes on too long.</i>

00:17:50.590 --> 00:17:52.090
<i>Should I go there to help them?</i>

00:18:02.310 --> 00:18:03.770
<i>Vita-chan?</i>

00:18:03.770 --> 00:18:06.850
<i>Damn it... there's another one over here.</i>

00:18:06.850 --> 00:18:08.650
<i>That one in white.</i>

00:18:09.150 --> 00:18:10.900
Takamachi Nanowhatever!

00:18:12.150 --> 00:18:14.530
It's Nanoha!

00:18:14.530 --> 00:18:16.650
Nanoha!

00:18:16.900 --> 00:18:17.950
Geez...

00:18:20.160 --> 00:18:25.200
Vita-chan, can't I hear what
you have to say after all?

00:18:25.830 --> 00:18:32.500
This is just a possibility... but...
maybe I can help you out?

00:18:36.920 --> 00:18:38.840
Shut up!

00:18:38.840 --> 00:18:42.180
As if I could believe anything someone
from the Administrative Bureau said!

00:18:42.600 --> 00:18:48.770
I'm not from the Administrative Bureau.
I'm just a civilian collaborator.

00:18:51.810 --> 00:18:55.860
<i>The Book can only collect
magic from a mage once.</i>

00:18:55.860 --> 00:19:00.530
<i>In other words, even if I defeat her,
she won't give me any pages.</i>

00:19:01.490 --> 00:19:04.280
<i>And I also want to avoid
wasting any cartridges...</i>

00:19:05.160 --> 00:19:06.790
Vita-chan!

00:19:07.250 --> 00:19:11.290
I'll have to pummel you some other time!

00:19:12.790 --> 00:19:15.750
Howl, Graf Eisen!

00:19:16.210 --> 00:19:17.760
(Iron Howl)
Eisengeheul.

00:19:28.350 --> 00:19:29.480
We're getting out of here!

00:19:37.820 --> 00:19:39.070
Master.

00:19:39.070 --> 00:19:40.030
Yeah.

00:19:41.530 --> 00:19:45.780
All right. She shouldn't be able
to hit me from this distance.

00:19:47.330 --> 00:19:48.790
Dimensional Teleport...

00:19:51.330 --> 00:19:55.040
Buster Mode. Drive Ignition.

00:19:58.510 --> 00:20:02.300
Let's go! I haven't used a
long-distance attack in a while!

00:20:02.300 --> 00:20:04.050
Load Cartridge.

00:20:08.810 --> 00:20:13.310
No way... she's going to fire?
From that distance?!

00:20:19.820 --> 00:20:22.400
Divine Buster.

00:20:22.400 --> 00:20:24.030
Extension.

00:20:24.700 --> 00:20:26.410
Divine...

00:20:30.540 --> 00:20:33.920
Buster!

00:20:35.710 --> 00:20:36.250
No way!

00:20:47.140 --> 00:20:48.640
It's a direct hit.

00:20:49.930 --> 00:20:51.850
Did I overdo it a little...?

00:20:51.890 --> 00:20:53.390
Don't worry.

00:21:04.700 --> 00:21:06.160
You're...

00:21:06.160 --> 00:21:07.070
Go.

00:21:07.070 --> 00:21:10.870
You're trying to complete the
Book of Darkness, aren't you?

00:21:16.580 --> 00:21:19.290
Divine...

00:21:22.210 --> 00:21:23.300
Master!

00:21:26.890 --> 00:21:27.970
A bind...?!

00:21:27.970 --> 00:21:32.270
No way! How could it form
instantly from that distance?!

00:21:45.200 --> 00:21:47.030
Sorry, Master.

00:21:47.860 --> 00:21:50.780
No... it was because
I let my guard down.

00:22:09.300 --> 00:22:12.720
<i>This far into the battle, and yet still so fast...</i>

00:22:12.720 --> 00:22:15.390
<i>She hit me with an attack
I couldn't even follow.</i>

00:22:15.980 --> 00:22:18.400
<i>If I don't finish this quickly,
I'll be in trouble.</i>

00:22:25.900 --> 00:22:27.900
<i>She's strong...</i>

00:22:27.900 --> 00:22:32.740
<i>She keeps overpowering
me in close and middle range...</i>

00:22:32.740 --> 00:22:35.540
<i>I'm just fooling her with my speed.</i>

00:22:36.080 --> 00:22:38.620
<i>If I take another strong blow
like that, I'll be finished!</i>

00:22:41.880 --> 00:22:45.300
<i>Will my Sturmfalken be able to hit her...?</i>

00:22:45.300 --> 00:22:49.430
<i>Do I have any choice but to use Sonic Form...?</i>

00:23:11.160 --> 00:23:12.450
Testarossa...!

00:23:18.710 --> 00:23:20.210
You...!

00:23:32.010 --> 00:23:34.930
Now... steal it.

00:25:09.320 --> 00:25:12.570
Fate-chan's Linker Core has been stolen!

00:25:12.570 --> 00:25:14.650
The Arthra has returned.

00:25:14.650 --> 00:25:18.070
But the mysteries of this case
have only become deeper.

00:25:18.070 --> 00:25:22.500
What did Yuuno-kun learn about
the Book of Darkness's past?

00:25:22.500 --> 00:25:25.500
Next time on
Mahou Shoujo Lyrical Nanoha A's:

00:25:25.500 --> 00:25:26.500
Episode 8:

00:25:26.500 --> 00:25:30.250
A Sad Resolve, and a Courageous Choice.

00:25:30.250 --> 00:25:32.420
Drive Ignition!
